Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.79,0:08:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[拉丁语]他要放您走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiere dejarte ir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.03,0:08:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我得保证留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pero tengo que prometer quedarme.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.61,0:08:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我女儿不走 我也不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No me iré sin mi hija.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.28,0:08:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}绝不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nunca.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.53,0:08:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要不放了她 抓我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deja que me atrape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.52,0:08:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我再说一次 先生 我绝不走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repito, señor, nunca me iré.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲 如他所说 我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Papá dijo que no teníamos elección.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.23,0:09:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不行 - 父亲 听我说 能走一个算一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No puedo. - Mi padre me escuchó decir que podía caminar uno por uno.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.48,0:09:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[拉丁语]保重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cuidate mucho.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.38,0:09:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要担心我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No te preocupes por mí.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.47,0:09:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Estarás bien.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信你是个可敬的敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creo que eres un enemigo honorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.84,0:09:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}希望你能对我的宝贝女儿以礼相待\N{\fnArial\fs30}Espero que trates a mi querida hija con cortesía.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.55,0:09:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我向您保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Le aseguro.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.92,0:30:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}（理查·雷兰）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.31,0:32:17.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}[拉丁语]我只想说 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sólo quiero decir que te quiero.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.07,0:02:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.23,0:02:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 装填弹药 - 准备就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Reload. - Stand ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.98,0:02:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝啊 你终于回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good God, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可寻到可食之物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you not find anything to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.11,0:02:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 我一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to find, my Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.93,0:02:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}整个国家 方圆数英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole countryside for miles and miles is stripped.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.10,0:02:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}猪兔牛羊已绝迹 无任何可食之物\N{\fnArial\fs30}of every sheep, cow, pig, hare… of anything edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:47.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}曾有法国农夫求见我们 以上帝之名\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had French peasants come up to us, crying piteously.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.87,0:02:49.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凄惨哀哭 乞求施舍给他们一片面包\N{\fnArial\fs30}in God's name for a piece of bread to keep alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.57,0:02:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}挽救他们饥肠辘辘的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}their little ones who are dying for want of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.40,0:02:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们孩子的死活与我而言无关痛痒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not their little ones I worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.24,0:02:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只关心我士兵的死活\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my own soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.31,0:02:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国人不会如往昔一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a pity the French will not come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.84,0:03:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀出来与我们一决胜负 这着实遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}and break lances with us, as they used to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若两军交锋 而我则能化身第一骑士兰斯洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I could truly fancy I was Lancelot Du Lac.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不是在这里坐以待毙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of sitting here in our own shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.14,0:03:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}徒为饿殍\N{\fnArial\fs30}and starving to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.48,0:03:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些试图逃跑的混蛋算是解脱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except for the bastards who try and run away!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.58,0:03:24.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}装弹药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reload!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.81,0:03:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快跑 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.58,0:03:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}停 停 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! Stop! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.92,0:03:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.73,0:03:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来吧 继续工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dai! Tornianno a lavorare.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.95,0:03:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伙计们 我们无暇胆颤\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not have time to be afraid, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.64,0:03:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走 回去工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道我们挖到哪儿了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Do you know where we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.95,0:04:10.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}离城堡还有300英尺之遥\N{\fnArial\fs30}The castle's still 300 feet away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.29,0:04:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.10,0:04:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有多少人死于血痢 - 截至目前吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How many men have died of the flux? - So far?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.63,0:04:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两千人 并且另有三千人身染此病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two thousand. And a further three thousand are sick with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.24,0:04:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不宜出战\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not fit to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.59,0:04:27.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}疫病在将我们有限的资源消耗殆尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sick are using up our limited resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.92,0:04:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 以微臣之见\N{\fnArial\fs30}In my opinion, your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.87,0:04:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应将病员与井分隔\N{\fnArial\fs30}they should be separated from the well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.82,0:04:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并把他们送回英格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}and transported back to England.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.73,0:04:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这将意味着我得从封锁线\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would mean that I would have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.03,0:04:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}撤下数艘船只\N{\fnArial\fs30}take several ships from my blockade!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.63,0:04:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这血痢使我们痛失锐气一蹶不振 病源为何\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is the cause of this bloody flux that so unmans us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.91,0:04:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 关于病源 众说纷纭 莫衷一是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty, there is much disagreement as to causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人说疫病起于缺少供给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some say it is the result of lack of supplies.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.81,0:04:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而还有人的观点恰恰相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}Others, by contrast,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.54,0:04:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}称疫病肆虐是因贪致祸\N{\fnArial\fs30}say it comes of greed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.10,0:04:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}士兵们刚刚抵达之时饥不择食\N{\fnArial\fs30}the men having gorged themselves on unripe fruit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.47,0:04:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胡乱以生水果和贝类充饥\N{\fnArial\fs30}and shellfish when they first arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能肯定的是 人类迄今\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is certain is that there is no way known to man.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:05:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对此疫病的蔓延一筹莫展\N{\fnArial\fs30}to stop its spreading infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果继续围攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the siege should continue for much longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.67,0:05:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕陛下军中的一大部分士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid a great portion of your Majesty's army will soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将很快埋骨布洛涅\N{\fnArial\fs30}be dug into the fields of Boulogne.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.31,0:05:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}休再对我口出此言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not hear anymore about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.01,0:05:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你跟那些法兰西人一样可恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are as much my enemy as the French,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.65,0:05:18.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}处处长他人志气\N{\fnArial\fs30}since you seek to demoralize, to lie about our weaknesses,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.76,0:05:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}灭自己威风\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to spin tales of sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.09,0:05:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些人并非身染瘟疫 而是为胆怯所吓\N{\fnArial\fs30}These men are not sick from the flux but from cowardice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.47,0:05:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我决不会让那些懦夫如愿返乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will not send cowards home!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.94,0:05:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们要么战死 要么被我悬尸路旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will either fight or I will hang them by the wayside.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.23,0:05:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你 让他们滚下病床\N{\fnArial\fs30}You! Get them from their sickbeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.60,0:05:36.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回到战壕里去 否则我要你项上人头\N{\fnArial\fs30}back into that trench, or I will make you a head shorter.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.21,0:05:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.28,0:05:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有 以后要对我据实以报\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in the future… tell me the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.35,0:05:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许按照名字的首字母顺序…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps the initials of these names…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.57,0:06:01.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 加德纳主教求见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, Bishop Gardiner asks for an audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.46,0:06:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.74,0:06:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 吾等告退 走吧 女士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty. Come, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.93,0:06:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.13,0:06:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.89,0:06:22.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敢问关于陛下及其战事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have come to hear if there is any fresh news of the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.31,0:06:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可有新消息传来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his affairs?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.79,0:06:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下一切安好 状态极佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King is very well and in the best of spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.48,0:06:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说他身心俱愉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am told he has never seemed happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.21,0:06:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们都将为陛下的健康及成功而祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all pray for the King's life and his success.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.51,0:06:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 既然现在您代陛下执掌朝纲\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is one matter I should discuss with your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.52,0:06:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那臣有一事与您相商\N{\fnArial\fs30}since you act as Regent in his absence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.98,0:06:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但说无妨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.66,0:06:49.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我等近来在陛下身边的乐师中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having discovered a nest of heretics.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抄剿了一个异教徒的老巢\N{\fnArial\fs30}among the King's musicians… and destroyed it…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.03,0:06:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们发现甚至在陛下的王室中\N{\fnArial\fs30}We now discover that there are heretics.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.93,0:06:56.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也有异教徒潜伏\N{\fnArial\fs30}even in the King's privy chambers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.30,0:07:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 您所指何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of whom do you speak, my Lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.59,0:07:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下的理发师及御厨\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King's barber and the royal cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已掌握了足够的证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have enough evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.90,0:07:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}起草控书\N{\fnArial\fs30}to draw up this draft indictment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.02,0:07:12.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只需陛下签字即可\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that we require is your signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.31,0:07:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 我为您的兢兢业业而叹服\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lord, I praise you for your diligence in these matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.01,0:07:21.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我认为 要拘捕陛下如此亲信之人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I do not think it proper to arrest men.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.37,0:07:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理当先问过陛下才是\N{\fnArial\fs30}so close to the King's person…without first asking him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.55,0:07:35.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对了 还有一事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and there is one other matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.43,0:07:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听说温莎地区附近瘟疫肆虐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have heard rumors of an outbreak of plague near Windsor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.08,0:07:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想把爱德华王子召入宫中\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I have decided to invite the Prince Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.34,0:07:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}与我同住\N{\fnArial\fs30}to come here to court and stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.59,0:07:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如您所愿 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you wish, Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.72,0:08:25.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pere!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.95,0:08:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 父亲 - 宝贝 我的宝贝女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Papa! - Chere! Mon cherie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.67,0:08:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Comment vas tu?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.96,0:08:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 没事 我很好 - 小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Je vais bien. Tres bien. - Mademoiselle,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.88,0:08:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要你肯合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}in return for your cooperation,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.54,0:08:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就放你父亲走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have decided to allow your father to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.86,0:08:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}My cooperation?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.07,0:08:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你必须保证不会试着逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must promise not to try and escape yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.42,0:09:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我父亲同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father agrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.57,0:09:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.04,0:09:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他必须马上动身了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.31,0:09:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会想念您的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.81,0:10:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带他出去 放了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relee him outside the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.13,0:10:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还好吗 哈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how are things, Harry?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.06,0:10:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.49,0:10:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给 这儿有些吃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Here's some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.17,0:10:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那是你的口粮 - 你比我更需要它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's your food. - You need it more than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只是终日坐着打发时间而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just sit outside and watch the seagulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.19,0:10:48.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.78,0:10:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吃吧 哈里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eat it, Harry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.45,0:11:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有那些宝马良驹 简直妙不可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the horses! The horse is magnificent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.68,0:11:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}非常欢迎你来 赫福德大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bid you most welcome, my Lord Hertford.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.86,0:11:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能来此 说明你对王后执掌朝政\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it your visit here confirms your confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.84,0:11:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 非常放心 - 是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- in the Queen's Regency! - Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于凯瑟琳王后的执政能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, I have heard nothing but praise.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.77,0:11:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}臣所耳闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}in all quarters for the dedication.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.57,0:11:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}皆为褒奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}and skill of Queen Catherine in matters of state.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.59,0:11:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她头脑清醒 睿智过人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has great clarity of mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.18,0:11:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}男人好鲁莽行事 气愤抱怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a woman's touch which soothes and cures.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.08,0:11:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王后的韧性恰好能弥补这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}where a man would usually rush into anger and complaint.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.51,0:11:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}王子还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.60,0:11:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华王子喜乐安康\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince Edward is well and healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.43,0:11:47.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 为王子的健康干杯 - 为王子干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A toast to his health! - To the Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 为爱德华王子干杯 - 为王子干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- To Prince Edward. - To the Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.28,0:11:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it round!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.67,0:11:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:11:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不得不禀报陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to tell your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.23,0:12:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我收到消息 皇帝已拿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I have received word that the Emperor has seized.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.68,0:12:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其所攻打的要塞\N{\fnArial\fs30}both the fortresses he was besieging,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.71,0:12:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且俘获1500名敌军\N{\fnArial\fs30}and has taken fifteen hundred enemy prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.84,0:12:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特雷维索 我早说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I tell you, Senor Treviso?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.20,0:12:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认定你的计策会失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never trusted your methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.64,0:12:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 一切都拖得太久了 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everything has taken too long. - Majesty…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.51,0:12:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不懂得如何带兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't know how to handle the soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.40,0:12:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没人在行\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:19.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓 该早点让你明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to God I could have told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.41,0:12:22.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}包围战令大军孤立无援 百无聊赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Siege warfare makes men idle and bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.72,0:12:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}委顿不堪 我说的对吗 公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}They get soft. Isn't that right, your Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.83,0:12:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 军队战斗力下降 - 的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The men get soft. - It's true,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.45,0:12:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}军营里到处充斥着妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}the camp is swarming with prostitutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.18,0:12:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但即便如此 考虑到当地情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even so, considering the conditions…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.75,0:12:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若遭遇突袭 我要确保大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to make sure of the troops' good behaviour.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.39,0:12:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能够英勇作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}in case of an assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.50,0:12:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们应提前引爆城墙下的一处炸药\N{\fnArial\fs30}We shall explode one of the charges under the castle walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.81,0:12:40.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}出其不意\N{\fnArial\fs30}prematurely…without warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.12,0:12:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此我们便可在危急之时\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way, we can observe the temper.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.43,0:12:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}察知大军性情及应变能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the disposition of the troops in a sudden crisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.07,0:12:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 请听我说 求您了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, please. Listen to me, I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.71,0:12:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}城堡之下隧道挖成指日可待\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are only days away from mining under the castle…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.30,0:12:52.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝份上 求您网开一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the love of God, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.74,0:12:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无辜丧命之人已数不胜数\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many, many lives lost, and for what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.04,0:12:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 请您给我两天时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, give me two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.32,0:13:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是你的饭食吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your food. Isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.49,0:13:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}城里的人呢 他们吃什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the people in the town? What are they eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.95,0:13:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有猫的就吃猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their cats. If they have cats.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.78,0:13:33.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大炮来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cannons coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.62,0:13:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们需要帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need some help over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.12,0:13:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为什么放了我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you let my father go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.74,0:13:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我审问过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I questioned him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.05,0:13:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对城中防御一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}He couldn't tell me anything useful about the town's defenses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.79,0:13:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你以为我知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.28,0:13:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为何把我囚禁于此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you keeping me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.96,0:14:07.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那些步枪准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are those muskets prepared?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.62,0:14:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.23,0:14:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我翻译了伊拉兹马斯所著的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty. I wanted to show.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.69,0:14:24.66,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3} 《约翰福音》 请您过目\N{\fnArial\fs30}you my translation of Erasmus's "Gospel of St.John".
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.39,0:14:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}虽然刚刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is only started.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.45,0:14:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但这是献给您的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is dedicated to you…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.08,0:14:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我知道我们的信仰对您是多么重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since I know how much our faith matters to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.05,0:14:40.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多谢费心 玛丽女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.42,0:14:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我深受感动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am deeply touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.83,0:14:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.19,0:14:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能和你们三个在一起令我欣喜不已\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is so nice for me. To be with all three of you together…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.31,0:15:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一家人本该如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which I think is as it should be!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.10,0:15:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱德华王子 请殿下注意言行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Prince Edward! Prince Edward! A little decorum, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.15,0:15:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 爱德华 - 殿下 请过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Edward! - Come here, your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.03,0:15:18.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.38,0:15:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你爱布莱恩女士 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you love the Lady Bryan, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.02,0:15:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想她也爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she loves you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.99,0:15:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我想如今确是殿下该离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think that it is time you were breeched.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.75,0:15:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布莱恩女士和奶妈的时候了\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the Lady Bryan and her nurses.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.90,0:15:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}殿下年岁已足 是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think that you are old enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.39,0:15:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟随导师学习了 殿下认为呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}to be placed with your tutors, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.55,0:15:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.21,0:15:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}殿下毋需担心 自然有其他男孩伴读\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, don't worry. There'll be other boys too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.25,0:15:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如萨福克公爵的儿子亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}There'll be the Duke of Suffolk's son Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:46.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不仅局限于学习语言和圣经\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it won't be all learning languages.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.34,0:15:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还会学习网球和剑术\N{\fnArial\fs30}and scriptures. You'll also learn tennis and fencing,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.30,0:15:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}音乐和舞蹈 会很有意思的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}music and dance. Well, that will be fun, won't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.47,0:15:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安 王子殿下 谢谢你 布莱恩女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night, Prince. Lady Bryan, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.17,0:16:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下晚安 - 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good night, your Majesty. - Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.81,0:16:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.90,0:16:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 晚安 陛下 - 晚安 玛丽女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good night, your Majesty. - Good night, Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.84,0:16:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来 小姑娘 让我抱抱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, young lady. Let me hug you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.06,0:16:27.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我对你期望甚高 你一定不会令我失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I expect great things of you, and I shall not be disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.85,0:16:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一定尽力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.56,0:16:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宝贝 去睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now off to bed, sweet girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾什莉小姐 请等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistress Ashley, a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.80,0:16:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安 你过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.95,0:16:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我认为你值得信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe that I can trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.17,0:17:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我听说你家人都是改革者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think that your family are reformers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.97,0:17:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.23,0:17:07.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白女士的生母 安妮·博林\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Elizabeth's mother, Anne Boleyn,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.73,0:17:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也曾是路德教徒和改革者\N{\fnArial\fs30}was also a Lutheran and a reformer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.68,0:17:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以 我认为这是我的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose it is my duty, therefore,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.45,0:17:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让她的女儿和母亲信仰一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}to bring the daughter up in the mother's faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.04,0:17:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱什莉小姐 你对此有何异议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you have any objection to that, Mistress Ashley?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.43,0:17:19.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并无异议 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}None, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.13,0:17:21.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很荣幸可以帮助公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be proud to help the Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.72,0:17:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}承续其母亲的荣耀与慈辉 她的一生及信仰\N{\fnArial\fs30}thus honor the memory of her mother, whose life and whose faith…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.79,0:17:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此崇重 怎能被轻易诋散\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many so easily disparage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 那么我将指派\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Then I will appoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.72,0:17:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗杰·阿舍姆做她的导师 他也是我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}as her tutor Roger Ascham. He is also one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.59,0:17:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爱什莉小姐 记住 此次谈话请务必保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mistress Ashley, this conversation never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.09,0:17:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 晚安 - 晚安 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good night. - Good night, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.88,0:17:43.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.94,0:18:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.78,0:18:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我违背了自己的诺言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I broke my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.65,0:18:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我逃跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.61,0:18:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.98,0:18:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的头还在渗血\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got blood on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.00,0:20:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}开火 前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take shots. Come on! Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.65,0:20:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前进 勇往直前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forward! For your lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.16,0:20:51.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}感谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.60,0:20:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.98,0:20:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能与你们并肩奋战\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has been an honor and a privilege.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.97,0:20:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实感荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}to have worked alongside men such as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.64,0:21:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝与你同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}God be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.13,0:21:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 保重 - 上帝保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Gratia. - God bless you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.35,0:21:25.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}保重 米勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gratia Mille.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.11,0:21:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.75,0:21:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}清开道路 清开道路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clear the way! Clear the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.78,0:22:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点 吉罗拉莫 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on Girolamo, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.56,0:22:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.10,0:22:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.10,0:22:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他欺骗了我 这个诳徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lied to me! He's a charlatan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.36,0:22:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}吉罗拉莫又犯傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girolamo's mad again!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.76,0:23:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.84,0:23:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.78,0:23:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 吉罗拉莫 - 别管我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Girolamo! - Save yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.77,0:23:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快过来 快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in here, get in here, get in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.09,0:23:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're injured in the mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.21,0:23:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这有人 快点 把他弄出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found somebody! Quickly, get him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.76,0:24:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继续 继续啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on! Go on, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.58,0:24:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰万岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}England!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.81,0:24:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}城墙塌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The wall is down!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.82,0:24:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有其他人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.62,0:24:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有别人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are there any others?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.48,0:24:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 还有其他人活着吗 - 没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is there anyone else alive in there? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.63,0:25:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}万岁 英格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}England!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.63,0:25:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}队列指挥官 集合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Section Commanders, form up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.14,0:25:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}集合队伍 准备攻城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Form up your men! Prepare to take the city!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.10,0:25:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forward!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.20,0:25:21.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 准备攻城 - 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Prepare to take the city! - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.72,0:25:32.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}孩子们 玛丽女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Children! Lady Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.62,0:25:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是从法国传来的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is great news from France!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.33,0:25:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王已经攻克了布洛涅\N{\fnArial\fs30}The king has taken Boulogne.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.83,0:25:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他神勇无敌并大获全胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is safe and triumphant.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.24,0:25:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的父王是个大英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father is a hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.67,0:25:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他夺回了布洛涅\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has captured Boulogne!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.10,0:25:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他很快便能凯旋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm certain he'll be home very soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.48,0:25:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.50,0:26:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}面对所向披靡的国王陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most victorious Prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.24,0:26:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为布洛涅的总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}as Governor of Boulogne,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.81,0:26:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只能选择投降并交出城镇钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no choice but to surrender the keys of the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.95,0:26:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有劳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.69,0:26:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信仁慈的陛下可以允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust your Majesty will allow the inhabitants.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.12,0:26:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}城内居民以及卸甲的兵丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the town and its unarmed garrison.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.06,0:26:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安然离去\N{\fnArial\fs30}to leave unmolested and in safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.14,0:27:03.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以国王的名誉保证其安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do so swear, on my honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.12,0:27:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管你等愚众 曾弃神乱旨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although you and your company, despite God's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.03,0:27:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}逆天行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and contrary to all justice,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.82,0:27:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}强占应属本王继承的领土\N{\fnArial\fs30}withheld from me a town which, being a noble part.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.73,0:27:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰的城池\N{\fnArial\fs30}of my inheritance, belonged to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.65,0:27:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恭贺陛下此番得胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I congratulate your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.74,0:27:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}全法国最为峻丽的城镇已归于您的麾下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have captured one of the most beautiful towns in France.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.62,0:27:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弹尽粮绝之际 他们有人吃起了马肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}In their great necessity, many of them ate horseflesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.41,0:27:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看他们落荒而逃时 连牧师都饿得清秀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see them go out? Even the priests were thin!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.29,0:27:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说说看 赫福德大人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, my Lord Hertford…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.70,0:27:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此役得失究竟如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it well done or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.09,0:27:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夺回属于我们的遗产和领土\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it not God's will that we should reclaim.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.30,0:27:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是否顺应神意\N{\fnArial\fs30}part of our just rights and inheritance?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.98,0:27:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 夺回布洛涅一役\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty, the capture of Boulogne.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.71,0:28:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}必将永驻每位英国子民的心中\N{\fnArial\fs30}will live forever in the hearts of all Englishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.69,0:28:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亨利八世 将成为我大英王族\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the eighth Henry as well as the fifth,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.76,0:28:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第五位彪炳史册的君主\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the glorious annals of our realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.09,0:28:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我视布洛涅为「掌上明珠」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call Boulogne "Our daughter."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.24,0:28:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我便应是「布洛涅的太王圣父」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I am the "King's Highness of Boulogne!"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.69,0:28:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我很期待 - 赫福德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I look forward… - Hertford.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.32,0:28:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 陛下 - 我在那还有很多未完成的生意\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Majesty. - I have a lot of unfinished business there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.37,0:28:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 诸位 干杯 - 干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A toast! To all. - To all!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.55,0:28:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 为胜利干杯 - 为胜利干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And to victory. - And to victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.98,0:28:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.41,0:28:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.43,0:28:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人 我要特别感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace, I have much to thank you for.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.61,0:28:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此次战役中 你可谓战绩出众 功勋卓越\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have distinguished yourself above all in this campaign.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.99,0:28:57.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢陛下隆恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am grateful to your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.02,0:29:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}臣忖度 接下来是否要进军巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, I assume, we are march on Paris?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.84,0:29:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为何有如此想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you assume that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.80,0:29:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下恕罪 臣愚钝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, your Majesty. I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.10,0:29:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}臣窃以为与罗马帝国结盟正为此番\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that was the purpose of the pact with the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.24,0:29:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在你看来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.90,0:29:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此刻正值寒冬 我军损兵折将\N{\fnArial\fs30}we should march on Paris with half an army,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.06,0:29:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}病残累累 何以进攻巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}with thousands of sick soldiers, and in winter?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.79,0:29:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 非也\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, your Grace,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.49,0:29:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 布洛涅于我更重于巴黎\N{\fnArial\fs30}right now, Boulogne is now far more important to me than Paris…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.56,0:29:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}岂止十倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than ten Parises!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.12,0:29:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就此打住 班师回朝\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we shall back to England.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.48,0:29:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我军已夺得大捷\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have gained here a singular victory…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.60,0:29:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经心满意足\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I mean to hold onto it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.46,0:29:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}命萨里留守既可\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall leave Surrey in command of the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.59,0:29:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 萨里大人 - 正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Surrey? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.75,0:29:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有何异议 公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a problem, your Grace?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.79,0:29:52.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回陛下 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.32,0:29:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.59,0:31:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.06,0:31:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说的是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.77,0:31:19.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把那边的木头搬走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move all that wood over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.36,0:31:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可以走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I free to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.99,0:31:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.26,0:31:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're free to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.75,0:31:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不拿我换赎金了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't ask for a ransom?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.20,0:31:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不 - 都给我站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Up on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.61,0:31:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是不是觉得我一文不值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then do you think I'm not worth anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.01,0:31:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是我心中至宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are worth everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.67,0:31:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是否还要火药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need some more powder?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.88,0:31:54.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 跟我回去 - 回哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come back with me. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.78,0:31:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}To England.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.32,0:31:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 给你当… - 是的长官 直走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- As your… - Yes sir, straight away, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.17,0:32:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}情妇 你的法国婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}…mistress? Your French whore?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.09,0:32:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不是 - 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.48,0:32:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Je t'aime.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.23,0:33:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.23,0:33:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.95,0:33:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得见陛下龙体康健\N{\fnArial\fs30}it makes me so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.32,0:33:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}臣妾喜不自胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see you so well and happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.26,0:33:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更能安全还朝 感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And returned safe, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.34,0:33:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有战事大捷 感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}And victorious, thank God!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.70,0:33:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有战事大捷\N{\fnArial\fs30}And victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.32,0:33:57.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}凯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.96,0:35:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}各位同僚 此般大肆宴席\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, for all this celebration,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.16,0:35:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我却甚为担忧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am very worried about our state of affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.41,0:35:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王大举征战 国库恐已告罄\N{\fnArial\fs30}The King's enterprise has bankrupted our exchequer.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.80,0:35:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}理查德大人 我所言不虚吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that not correct, Sir Richard?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.91,0:35:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已经无计可施\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are at our wit's end to know how to get revenues.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.98,0:35:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}筹不到布洛涅战款\N{\fnArial\fs30}to pay for the Boulogne campaign,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.92,0:35:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}甚至今后两三月的开支都无法承担\N{\fnArial\fs30}or even shift for the next two or three months.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.28,0:35:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}近日 我国频频与法国和苏格兰开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are at war with France and with Scotland.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.09,0:35:36.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马主教对此恨之入骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have the enmity of the Bishop of Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.13,0:35:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此罗马帝国与我方盟约已裂\N{\fnArial\fs30}We no longer have assurances of friendship with the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.05,0:35:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这场大战不得民心\N{\fnArial\fs30}This war has proved noisome to the realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.18,0:35:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且致使民生凋敝\N{\fnArial\fs30}and disastrous for our merchants.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.44,0:35:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们 上帝助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh gentlemen, God help us,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.74,0:35:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如今的世道\N{\fnArial\fs30}we live in a world where.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.21,0:35:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知礼之古风不再\N{\fnArial\fs30}reason and learning no longer prevail.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.92,0:35:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}盟约无信义可言\N{\fnArial\fs30}and covenants are little regarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.40,0:35:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更有甚者 当今王后竟然是异教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where it seems even our Queen is a heretic.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.48,0:36:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所言极是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.78,0:36:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此大逆之人必遭天谴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it will be God's work to destroy her.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.36,0:36:17.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大使大人 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Excellency. - Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.32,0:36:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大使大人 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Excellency. - Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.31,0:36:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}二位陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesties,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.60,0:36:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下臣此番前来告知\N{\fnArial\fs30}you should know that,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.03,0:36:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由于臣年老多病\N{\fnArial\fs30}due to my infirmity,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.73,0:36:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特提请告老还乡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have applied for a recall to Spain.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.80,0:36:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此刻下臣正在等待罗马皇帝钦允\N{\fnArial\fs30}and even now I am awaiting the Emperor's permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.84,0:36:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.87,0:37:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}臣愿借此良机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to take this opportunity to thank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.84,0:37:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}代罗马皇帝陛下感谢您\N{\fnArial\fs30}on behalf of his Majesty the Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.45,0:37:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}悉心抚育玛丽女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}for all that you have done for the Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.41,0:37:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以及为英西两国邦交友好竭尽心力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and for fostering the friendship between England and Spain.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.49,0:37:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大使大人 本宫对玛丽女士之情谊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellency, what I have done for the Lady Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.87,0:37:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本不足一提\N{\fnArial\fs30}is much less than I would like to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.14,0:37:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}更是职之所系\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as being my duty in every respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.33,0:37:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而言及两国邦交友好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as for the friendship between our two countries,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.04,0:37:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既是对两国不可或缺 大有裨益\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have done and will do nothing to prevent it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.85,0:37:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本宫之前不予插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}from growing still further, as the friendship is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.83,0:37:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今后更是不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}so necessary and both sovereigns…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.53,0:37:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阻挠\N{\fnArial\fs30}so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.51,0:37:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 您所言极是\N{\fnArial\fs30}As are you, my Lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.51,0:37:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大使大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excellency!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.52,0:37:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.31,0:37:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}寡人得知贵国国王和法王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear your Master has signed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.50,0:37:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}签署单方协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}a separate treaty with the French.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.89,0:37:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可有此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.47,0:37:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我问你可有此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked you if it was true!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.63,0:37:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}难以启齿吗 尤斯塔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it so hard a question, Eustace?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.98,0:38:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}回禀陛下 确有此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it's true, your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.58,0:38:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他为何如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why should he do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.67,0:38:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们本是同盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were supposed to be allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.14,0:38:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下定然别无他选\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe his Majesty had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.25,0:38:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}卢森堡一役 我军久攻不下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had spent too long besieging the town of Luxembourg;
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.25,0:38:17.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将士疾病缠身 战力锐减\N{\fnArial\fs30}His army was riddled with disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.02,0:38:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那也不能做出此等勾当\N{\fnArial\fs30}He still should not have done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.64,0:38:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欺瞒寡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Behind my back!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.79,0:38:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朕如此信任他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trusted him…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.32,0:38:26.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他却背信弃义 - 陛下 我相信…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And he betrayed me. - Your Majesty, I am sure…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.84,0:38:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别说了 你这辈子都在为他辩解\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you defended and excused him your whole life!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.88,0:38:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他根本不值得信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is not to be trusted…
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.65,0:38:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你也省省吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you should be relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.09,0:38:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今后不必再殚精竭虑 满嘴谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you no longer have to lie on his behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.17,0:38:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朕赐你离开宫廷\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my permission to leave my court.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.18,0:38:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早日卸甲归田 尽享天伦 退下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish you a long and happy retirement, your Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.85,0:38:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 臣告退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.67,0:39:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大使阁下 - 再会 大使阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your Excellency. - Farewell, your Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.56,0:39:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝保佑 大使阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}God speed, your Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.71,0:39:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她比我高吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is taller than me, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.70,0:39:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}略高一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.39,0:39:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是个怎样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you describe her?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.19,0:39:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她是我妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would describe her as my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.91,0:39:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我何时能见见她\N{\fnArial\fs30}When shall I meet her?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.84,0:39:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想见她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to meet her?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.19,0:39:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 只是想见见你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But your son…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.97,0:39:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是亨利吧 有空想见见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry? Yes, sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.45,0:39:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.91,0:40:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想我曾心如死水\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I was dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.56,0:40:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如今又枯木逢春\N{\fnArial\fs30}and am alive again.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.41,0:40:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.95,0:40:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说话啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.45,0:40:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽在不言中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Words aren't important.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.31,0:41:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能走 我不许你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mustn't go. I forbid it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.43,0:41:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女士 我别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Lady, I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.83,0:41:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你很清楚我无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see how it is with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.80,0:41:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那我怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.98,0:41:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女士 让凯瑟琳王后照顾您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam, I don't think I could have ever left you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.56,0:41:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再好不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in better care than Queen Catherine's.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.47,0:41:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我相信她爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe she loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.30,0:41:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她也许爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She may love me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.72,0:41:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.67,0:41:45.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只知道她与我们信仰不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I do know is that she is not of our faith.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.82,0:41:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管她努力伪装 但毕竟不是天主教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}She pretends… but she is not a Catholic.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.41,0:41:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 她是异教徒 你还让她照顾我 - 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She is a heretic- and still you leave me in her care! - Madam…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.58,0:41:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.87,0:41:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it is not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.01,0:42:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我的错 如果我身为王子 而非女儿身\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my fault. If I had been a boy and not a girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.85,0:42:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这一切就不会发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}none of this would have ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.34,0:42:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰必会虔诚如昔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And England would still be faithful.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.17,0:42:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公主 我恳求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Princess! I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.94,0:42:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我年岁见长 早非懵懂孩童\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a lot older than I was when I first knew you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.35,0:42:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也懂明察世事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And wiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.78,0:42:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道将来能否结婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know if I shall ever be married,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.44,0:42:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}能否登基为王\N{\fnArial\fs30}or if I will ever be Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.91,0:42:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许都不行 但若有朝一日成为女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably neither. But if I do become Queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.49,0:42:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在愿以圣福音书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to you now on the Holy Gospels.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.14,0:42:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和生母的灵魂发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}and on the soul of my mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.78,0:42:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}定要让英格兰虔诚向教 绝无二心\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I will make England faithful again.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.84,0:42:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我愿为此付出一切代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will do whatever it takes,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.75,0:42:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不管要烧死多少异教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will burn however many heretics I have to,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.71,0:42:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哪怕血流成河 尸横遍野\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will spill as much blood as I have to,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.45,0:42:48.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也要让这不幸的国度重归天主教的怀抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make this unfortunate realm Catholic again,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.22,0:42:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医病疗伤 愿神助我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and heal it, so help me God.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.75,0:43:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告辞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.32,0:43:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}收下这枚戒指\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.75,0:43:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但求睹物思人\N{\fnArial\fs30}in memory of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.85,0:43:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是罗马皇帝赐我的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a gift from the Emperor…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.83,0:43:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是你母亲送给他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who received it from your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.13,0:44:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}启禀陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.78,0:44:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们收到消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have received news that,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.17,0:44:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}罗马皇帝不仅与法国\N{\fnArial\fs30}as well as concluding his separate peace treaty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.86,0:44:32.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在克雷西握手言和\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the French at Crecy, the Emperor has.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.67,0:44:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还准许其女儿与\N{\fnArial\fs30}given permission for a marriage between his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.07,0:44:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}奥尔良公爵成婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Duke of Orleans.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.60,0:44:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.02,0:44:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不止这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is further news.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.86,0:44:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们得知法国皇太子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We understand that the Dauphin,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.86,0:44:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}率领三万六千人的大军\N{\fnArial\fs30}and an army of over 36, 000 men.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.81,0:44:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}准备进军布洛涅\N{\fnArial\fs30}are preparing to march on Boulogne.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.29,0:45:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朕要欣赏普天同庆 举国欢腾的景象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want my victory to be celebrated in every house in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.37,0:45:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此战之辉煌 必将万古传扬\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was, after all, a very glorious affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.11,0:45:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你去安排 要让每座教堂鸣钟致谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to arrange for every bell to be rung.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.38,0:45:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要让感恩的祷文响彻云霄\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a mass of Thanksgiving to be said in every church.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.72,0:45:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}朕要布洛涅这个名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the name "Boulogne"
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.91,0:45:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}铭刻在每个英国人心中\N{\fnArial\fs30}imprinted on every English heart…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.59,0:45:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一如「阿金库尔」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like "Agincourt"!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.16,0:45:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}遵命 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, your Majesty.
